  "title": "Bourbon Mango Pulled Pork",
  "description": "A recipe for pulled pork and mango BBQ sauce that balances spicy, smoky, and sweet. It&#39;s easy to prepare in the slow cooker and makes a great sandwich.",
  "authors": [
